  {
   "text": "{\"explanations\":[{\"signal_id\":\"5dd32e12-716c-4921-9bdc-93291afcfd11\",\"explanation\":\"Cash headroom has shrunk steadily, from {{fact:14f2cb5c-a299-4c98-b07f-26f6c522bfa7}} in August to {{fact:8be6e746-dc43-4b96-aecc-08d235db6b5b}} in October, with cash at {{fact:babfaa0c-ec08-429f-8055-ec6bc6e11692}} against a {{fact:88f34b53-998a-4771-8672-2e6c09998c39}} floor. The cushion is still comfortable, but the pace of decline matters. Revenue is running ahead of plan, so the cash drain likely stems from spending or working capital rather than weak sales.\"},{\"signal_id\":\"0fb5ea65-8cfd-4014-a794-e9b0147b8b17\",\"explanation\":\"Headroom slipped only marginally, from {{fact:def82ec4-851e-46d9-b5d5-6ce0d5c3f318}} to {{fact:cb16809d-b762-499d-9bf6-cf6b3afbf507}}, and revenue sits at {{fact:442f16be-a50d-45ce-bd68-1b92f3bf5bee}} of plan versus a {{fact:fe18f623-95a9-4579-ad42-444fe67aed32}} minimum. This is close to flat and does not explain the falling cash balance.\"}],\"ranking\":[\"5dd32e12-716c-4921-9bdc-93291afcfd11\",\"0fb5ea65-8cfd-4014-a794-e9b0147b8b17\"]}",
   "type": "text"
  }
 ],
